---
source: Ace moderation profile shows a fan's submissions, warnings, mute and notes
expression: String
---
- header:
  - text "Ace"
  - heading "Rosa Diaz" [level=1]
  - text "Rosa Diaz"
  - text "@bleacher_creature"
  - text "Joined November 02, 2026"
- region "Posting moderation summary":
  - text "Muted until Nov 3, 2026 at 15:00 UTC"
  - text "1 warning · 1 mute"
  - text "1 submission · 0 approved · 0 rejected · 1 in review · 0 hidden"
  - text "0 reports received · 0 open"
- group:
  - summary "Warn"
  - form:
    - textbox "Warning reason" [multiline] [required]
    - combobox "Related submission" = ""
    - text "The ace can see this warning reason. It does not hide content."
    - button "Record warning"
- group:
  - summary "End mute early"
  - form:
    - textbox "Reason for ending mute" [multiline] [required]
    - text "The ace can see this reason. The original mute remains in history."
    - button "End mute"
- group:
  - summary "Add moderator note"
  - form:
    - textbox "Internal note" [multiline] [required]
    - text "Reviewers can read this note. It stays private from this ace, including if they are a reviewer."
    - button "Save moderator note"
- group:
  - summary "Escalate to admin"
  - text "Capture this case for an admin. Account permissions stay unchanged. Your reason stays private to reviewers who can view the case."
  - form:
    - textbox "Escalation reason" [multiline] [required]
    - button "Escalate to admin"
- nav "Ace moderation sections":
  - link "Submissions" → /moderate/aces/:id?tab=submissions
  - link "Reports" → /moderate/aces/:id?tab=reports
  - link "Warnings and mutes" → /moderate/aces/:id?tab=actions
  - link "Moderator notes" → /moderate/aces/:id?tab=notes
- list:
  - text "Check back after the mute ends"
  - text "Jules Okafor @fair_catch · November 02, 2026 15:00"
